      Start of Interval (ET)              End of Interval (ET)
      --------------------------------    --------------------------------
      1999 AUG 19 02:00:00.000            2001 MAR 24 00:00:00.000
 
Bodies: EARTH BARYCENTER (3)    SATURN BARYCENTER (6)   MOON (301)
        JUPITER BARYCENTER (5)  SUN (10)                EARTH (399)
        Start of Interval (ET)              End of Interval (ET)
        --------------------------------    --------------------------------
        1999 AUG 19 02:00:00.000            2001 MAR 24 00:00:00.000
 
Bodies: IO (501)                ELARA (507)             LEDA (513)
        EUROPA (502)            PASIPHAE (508)          THEBE (514)
        GANYMEDE (503)          SINOPE (509)            ADRASTEA (515)
        CALLISTO (504)          LYSITHEA (510)          METIS (516)
        AMALTHEA (505)          CARME (511)             JUPITER (599)
        HIMALIA (506)           ANANKE (512)
